  "description": "Variation of condition 1 of planning permission dated 20 Oct 2025 (RN: 25/06227/FULL) which varied condition 1 (and in turn amendments to conditions 21 and 24) of planning permission dated 2nd July 2024 (RN: 24/02998/FULL) for the Variation of condition 1 (and subsequent removal of Condition 23) of planning permission dated 03 July 2023 (RN: 22/08702/FULL) for alterations and extensions including the erection of additional storey at roof level with terrace, the in filling of existing rear yard at Bingham Place, and extensions to the rear elevation onto Bingham Place and side elevation onto Nottingham Place with associated balconies. Alterations in association to the use of the existing building as Class E, and provision of additional space for use as Class E (comprising Class E(c), E(d), E(e) and E(g)(i)). Namely, to allow the reintroduction of previously approved secondary entrance fronting onto Nottingham Place."
